    "type": "organization",
    "description": "Adeso, formerly known as Horn Relief, was established in 1991 in response to Somalia’s devastating humanitarian crisis and civil war. We started as a small grassroots organization dedicated to helping Somalia’s pastoralist groups, particularly women and youth. Adeso has since grown into an African-based organization working in Kenya, Somalia and South Sudan where we advocate for much-needed resources for our partner communities and work hard to co-create innovative long-lasting solutions.",
